.TH batten-modules-ratchet 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-modules\-ratchet \- Refuse any module\-graph metric worse than the committed record, and tighten the record on improvement
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten modules ratchet\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-record\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Refuse any module\-graph metric worse than the committed record, and tighten the record on improvement
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-record\fR \fI<record>\fR
The record file, one `<root> cycle=<n> propagation=<bp> impls=<n> shims=<n>` line per root
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Never write the record: one looser than the tree is refused too
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
